-6.745-4.715 0-7.483 3.538-7.483 7.196 0 1.425.548 2.95 1.232 3.785.135.165.155.31.114.478-.126.52-.403 1.653-.458 1.884-.073.304-.243.368-.56.222-2.082-.97-3.383-4.017-3.383-6.463 0-5.26 3.822-10.094 11.017-10.094 5.788 0 10.285 4.125 10.285 9.635 0 5.748-3.622 10.373-8.647 10.373-1.69 0-3.28-.879-3.824-1.914l-1.038 3.876c-.376 1.448-1.39 3.263-2.072 4.368.562.174 1.155.268 1.768.268C24.837 32 32 24.837 32 16S24.837 0 16 0z"}}]}]},{"t":"button","c":"react-share__ShareButton bg-[#7F7F7F] inline-flex h-[38px] w-[38px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded border-none","a":{"aria-label":"Share by email","type":"button"},"ch":[{"t":"svg","a":{"viewBox":"0 0 32 32","width":"20","height":"20","fill":"white"},"ch":[{"t":"path","a":{"d":"M16 2C8.28 2 2 8.28 2 16s6.28 14 14 14 14-6.28 14-14S23.72 2 16 2zm6.857 8.857L16 17 9.143 10.857h13.714zM9 21V12l7 6.5 7-6.5v9H9z"}}]}]}]},{"t":"div","c":"blog_dtl_article_content _position_relative","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"ProseMirror tiptap-html ","ch":[{"t":"div","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"tiptap ProseMirror","a":{"contenteditable":"false","role":"textbox","translate":"no"},"ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"a","a":{"target":"_blank","href":"https://www.savvypro.org/susan-mwenda-mulongoti/"},"ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"https://www.savvypro.org/susan-mwenda-mulongoti/"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"br","c":"ProseMirror-trailingBreak"}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"I am an Engineer turned Digital Strategist — a professional who blends logic with creativity to build growth systems that last."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Over the past fourteen years, I have helped organizations across "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Africa, Europe, the Middle East, and Australia"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" evolve from traditional marketing chaos into structured, data-driven growth machines."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Through my U.S.-registered firm "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Digital SavvyPro LLC"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" and my consulting practice "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"SavvyPro Consulting"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", I’ve worked with CEOs, agency founders, and senior executives who wanted more than visibility — they wanted "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"transformation"}]},{"t":"#text","x":"."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My greatest strength is clarity. I step into organizations that feel overwhelmed by digital change, diagnose the bottlenecks, and build marketing infrastructures that connect vision to execution. Whether it’s a startup needing a go-to-market system or an established enterprise seeking digital maturity, I design the framework, train the team, and set up the tools that make growth repeatable."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"aadc2a02-5e87-412c-b2d5-c2e1b013df51","data-toc-id":"aadc2a02-5e87-412c-b2d5-c2e1b013df51","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"From Engineering to Growth Leadership"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My career began in engineering — a discipline that taught me systems thinking, process optimization, and analytical precision."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"When I transitioned into digital marketing, I carried that mindset with me. I didn’t see “ads” or “content”; I saw "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"systems, feedback loops, and performance data."}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"That perspective allowed me to bridge two worlds: the creative energy of marketing and the discipline of engineering. It became my trademark — helping businesses build marketing that actually "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"works"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" because it’s structured, measurable, and human-centered."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"a776ca6e-c24c-478f-bc42-fa4f35bb0424","data-toc-id":"a776ca6e-c24c-478f-bc42-fa4f35bb0424","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Key Projects and Results"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"1. Trade Kings Group – FMCG | Zambia, Zimbabwe, South Africa"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"This was my earliest and most formative experience."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I started as a freelance social media manager and grew into leading digital marketing for multiple subsidiaries under one of Zambia’s largest FMCG corporations."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"In six years, I helped build the company’s online presence from "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"zero to over 500,000 followers"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", introducing a new era of consumer engagement for a legacy brand that had relied purely on traditional advertising for decades."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"That journey taught me the power of digital storytelling at scale — and how to create internal systems that sustain momentum even after the consultant leaves."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"2. Medlink Services – Healthcare Administration"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I guided this sixteen-year-old medical scheme administrator through its digital transition."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"The engagement covered "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"team training, strategy creation, and lead generation"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" across Facebook and LinkedIn."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"By the end of our program, Medlink had a capable in-house team, a unified content voice, and measurable brand visibility that positioned them competitively in an industry that had been slow to adopt digital outreach."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"3. Zynle Technologies – SaaS and Software Engineering"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"For this nine-year-old software company, I introduced structure to their marketing operations."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"We focused on "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"lead generation systems, app marketing, and brand storytelling"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", ensuring that a company known for technical brilliance could finally communicate its value online."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Our campaigns attracted new enterprise clients and improved their visibility among universities and institutions across Southern Africa."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"4. Golden Westcoast Pharmaceuticals – FMCG & Distribution"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"This ongoing engagement captures my Fractional CMO work perfectly."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I was brought in to "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"increase sales through distributor pull-through"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", using content marketing, advertising, and team coaching."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"We built an internal marketing unit, developed product positioning strategies, trained their marketer, and laid the foundation for "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"digitizing their distribution network"}]},{"t":"#text","x":"."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"The result — a brand that now connects better with both consumers and pharmacy partners, with a clear roadmap for regional expansion."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"5. Mwezzi Creative Media – Creative Agency"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I worked directly with the CEO and creative leads to refine their offer, generate consistent leads, and create a "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"sales management system"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" that connected marketing to closing."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"My role included campaign design, consulting on lead tracking tools, and mentoring their internal marketing team."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"This project deepened my expertise in agency operations — a space where I now specialize in helping agencies scale without chaos."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"6. SavvyPro & Content Creation School (CCS) – EdTech Platform"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I founded "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Content Creation School (CCS)"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" to teach Africans practical digital skills."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"The initiative has trained over "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"3,000 learners"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" and supported more than "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"100 businesses"}]},{"t":"#text","x":"."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"We developed a gamified learning ecosystem — the "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"CCS LearnSense Engine"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" — which rewards engagement, community participation, and skill mastery."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"It represents my belief that education and technology can bridge opportunity gaps across continents."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Through CCS, I’ve also built an internal mentorship pipeline, empowering young creators to become digital freelancers, content managers, and consultants who can earn online sustainably."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"7. International Consulting Highlights"}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Beyond Zambia, I’ve advised founders and CEOs in "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"South Africa, Kenya, Malawi, Botswana, Zimbabwe, the UAE, the Netherlands, and Australia."}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"These engagements include solar companies, e-commerce entrepreneurs, financial consultants, and coaches."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"In one case, I helped a South African solar company increase lead flow through "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Facebook Ads + SEO storytelling"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", while a Malawian finance CEO hired me for team training on digital sales transformation."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Each project reaffirmed that growth principles are universal — clarity, structure, and accountability drive results anywhere in the world."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"a1ad74ac-ded1-4d4e-8f0a-45e5a06b6a06","data-toc-id":"a1ad74ac-ded1-4d4e-8f0a-45e5a06b6a06","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Leadership Philosophy"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"I believe marketing leadership isn’t about noise — it’s about "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"alignment."}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"When the CEO, sales, creative, and data teams share the same language and metrics, marketing transforms from a cost center into a "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"growth engine."}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"That’s what I do as a Fractional CMO:"}]},{"t":"ul","ch":[{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Translate business goals into digital execution plans."}]}]},{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Build internal capability so teams stop depending on external agencies for every small task."}]}]},{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Introduce systems — analytics dashboards, CRM integrations, and SOPs — that bring consistency to creativity."}]}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My work is rooted in three principles:"},{"t":"br"},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Simplicity, Systems, and Scale."}]}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"4235ef5e-b7f6-4a33-9be4-1a82fc4dc927","data-toc-id":"4235ef5e-b7f6-4a33-9be4-1a82fc4dc927","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Cross-Functional Expertise"}]}]},{"t":"ul","ch":[{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Platforms:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" WordPress, Meta Ads Manager, LinkedIn Ads, Google Analytics (GA4), HubSpot, Zoho CRM, GoHighLevel, Hotjar."}]}]},{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Skills:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Digital Strategy, Funnel Design, Content Architecture, Campaign Management, Team Coaching, Growth Analytics."}]}]},{"t":"li","ch":[{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Industries:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" FMCG, Education, SaaS, Healthcare, Renewable Energy, Finance, and Creative Services."}]}]}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"a3a924ab-5470-4eb0-944c-76b768af2427","data-toc-id":"a3a924ab-5470-4eb0-944c-76b768af2427","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Recognition and Current Focus"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My proudest achievement isn’t one campaign — it’s the ecosystem I’ve built around learning and execution."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"I’m now channeling that into "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Digital SavvyPro LLC (U.S.)"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", serving as a Fractional CMO and Growth Strategist for international clients — particularly "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"agencies and legacy companies"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" ready to modernize their marketing and leadership systems."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"I’ve developed the "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"5-Level Marketing Budget Framework"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" and the "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Agency Systems Sprint"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", both used to help organizations understand how to invest intelligently and scale sustainably."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My next frontier is combining automation, AI, and human creativity into what I call "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"the LearnSense Ecosystem"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" — where marketing, education, and data flow seamlessly to empower both teams and founders."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h3","a":{"id":"346c8b28-0f38-4abd-a7df-a648166b793c","data-toc-id":"346c8b28-0f38-4abd-a7df-a648166b793c","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Closing Reflection"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"My journey has been anything but linear — from engineering blueprints to marketing roadmaps, from local gigs to global strategy rooms."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"But the thread running through it all is simple: "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"I build clarity."}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Because when businesses get clear about their message, systems, and leadership, everything else — sales, visibility, and impact — starts to flow."}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"t":"div","c":"_criClm_btm_overview_crd mb-5","ch":[{"t":"ul","c":"_criClm_btm_overview_crd_ul _mar_b15","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"!pt-3","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_timeline_content","a":{"id":"feed_comment"},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_timeline_content_inner d-flex justify-content-between _mar_b10","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_post_rctn d-flex _mar_b5"}]},{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_timeline_comment_area","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_comment_box","ch":[{"t":"form","c":"_feed_inner_comment_box_form","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_comment_box_content","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_comment_box_content_image","ch":[{"t":"img","c":"_comment_img","a":{"src":"https://letcheck.b-cdn.net/human_icon.png","alt":"User profile picture"}}]},{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_comment_box_content_txt","ch":[{"t":"div","c":"ant-mentions _reply_textarea","ch":[{"t":"textarea","c":"rc-textarea","a":{"placeholder":"Write something...","rows":"1"}}]},{"t":"div","c":"_feed_inner_comment_send_btn","ch":[{"t":"button","c":"_feed_inner_send_icon_btn","a":{"type":"button"},"ch":[{"t":"span","c":"anticon anticon-send","a":{"role":"img","aria-label":"send